WEBVTT

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:30.323
We have the knowledge
how to produce meat, eggs and milk

00:10:30.347 --> 00:10:33.735
without or with very low
amounts of antibiotics,

00:10:33.759 --> 00:10:36.308
and I'll argue it's a small price to pay

00:10:36.332 --> 00:10:39.430
to avoid a future
in which bacterial infections

00:10:39.454 --> 00:10:41.587
again become our biggest killer.

00:10:41.905 --> 00:10:43.078
Thank you.

00:10:43.102 --> 00:10:46.352
(Applause)